          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Following the victory against the orcs, Aiglondur was summoned to the audience hall of Hamel, Lord of Knalga and Lord Companion of the Northern Alliance. Beside the dais stood a stranger in the robes of the Order of Loremasters..."),
          },
        ],
